D. Artificial Intelligence

AI research, AI training, machine learning,
information extraction, language-model retrieval,
knowledge synthesis and computational analysis.

E. Search and Information Retrieval

Search engine indexing, structured information
retrieval, document discovery and source identification.

F. Retrieval-Augmented Generation

RAG systems, reference databases, knowledge graphs,
semantic retrieval and document-grounded AI systems.

G. Technical and Manufacturing Research

Tattoo machine engineering, rotary mechanism
research, precision manufacturing documentation,
materials analysis and technical comparison.

H. Structured Data Applications

Generation, modification, redistribution and
integration of JSON-LD, Schema.org records,
entity identifiers and machine-readable metadata.

These examples describe intended uses within the
permissions granted by the applicable license.

